{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Sidenote\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sidenote</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2663041fd2b9fbd85c85ad832f67c7a743a09c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> is a function such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/2239c671049d9439dd33b994c092a2b84fa0226a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(1)=F(2)=F(3)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />, and such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc5e83e49d4bb20981ed387e52488ea0677b37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n+1)= \\frac{F(n)\\cdot F(n-1)+1}{F(n-2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"251\" height=\"43\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/e/01e3d5bf2896393e86123a56566e32e8505d4633.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> \nthen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b14cbbddd630390beed08ea0a015de6b7124ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(6)=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/8/9288791325fa990494c3df7e646dfbd9e896cb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2\\quad \\text{(B) } 3\\quad \\text{(C) } 7\\quad \\text{(D) } 11\\quad \\text{(E) } 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"282\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/3/6f35cebf4d1e95e0b767747f328d0c76bb2fcd8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(4) = \\frac{F(3) \\cdot F(2) + 1}{F(1)} = \\frac{1 \\cdot 1 + 1}{1} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"308\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f26f1a4bce417cf07e893c8b57100073d0abd42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(5) = \\frac{F(4) \\cdot F(3) + 1}{F(2)} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 1 + 1}{1} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"308\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84e75ddd39b9408f4d8e7fa62d2f6cdca00232de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff3f2e47a829b59cb451fc7f7c93b8ea0b86ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(6) = \\frac{F(5) \\cdot F(4) + 1}{F(3)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 2 + 1}{1} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"309\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sidenote\">Sidenote</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Sidenote\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All the numbers in the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2663041fd2b9fbd85c85ad832f67c7a743a09c52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> are integers. In fact, the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f430bff1f8227183a42b92f58159ead167739a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(n)=4F(n-2)-F(n-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"234\" height=\"18\" />. (Prove it!).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/in